<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.7600 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.7600 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7600 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday after 75.8000 on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 30		 July 29</p>
<p> High			     75.8000		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.7000		 75.7999</p>
<p> Open			     75.7000		 75.8000</p>
<p> Close			    75.7600		 75.8000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  2.865		   3.840</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
